{"ID":"20240314092321-f1pp7il","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092321-f1pp7il","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092321-f1pp7il\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155801-z8ns6dv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155801-kjd51d9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155801-kjd51d9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:134,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:134\u0026#125;","title":"【头风摩散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422155804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422155801-z8ns6dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-z8ns6dv","updated":"20240422155801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"头风摩散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155801-x577el5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-x577el5","updated":"20240422155801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大附子一枚（炮）盐等分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155801-7lnqwhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-7lnqwhq","updated":"20240422155801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味为散，沐了，以方寸匕，已摩疾上，令药力行。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155801-wlrm6ok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-wlrm6ok","updated":"20240422155801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“头风摩散”，这个药很好用，很好用哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155801-o70wj9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-o70wj9y","updated":"20240422155801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平常我们在扎针的时候，老师他说头痛，我们针下去，头就不痛了。好，比如说，他偏头痛， 这个太阳痛，我们用这个太阳透率谷，头就不痛了。那回家以后两小时就又开始痛了，那他家距离你这个诊所两小时车程，那扎一次针好两个小时，开两个小时回家，一进门头又开始痛了，然后就很麻烦，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240422155801-yzdo8w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-yzdo8w4","updated":"20240422155801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那就带点头风摩散回家。上面说大附子，不要去斤斤计较。用附子就对了，还分大小？盐等分，就是炮附子打成粉，跟盐，这个盐我们的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方里面用的盐，都是青盐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不要去拿那个海盐，用青盐，当然你如果说没有青盐，那只好用海盐呐，但是绝对不是用现在人工盐。青盐呢，在经方里面除了这个地方，头摩风散用以外，还有“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓戎盐汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”我们后面会介绍到，这个肾结石的时候，我们会用到青盐，哦，青盐颗粒比较大，那跟炮附子打成粉和在一起，那平常你就放在那边哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155801-davhcr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-davhcr8","updated":"20240422155801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般中药很好玩，你这两个青盐粉打好跟炮附子粉打好，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分两罐装，不要混在一起"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，意思就好像青菜你放在那边，不炒的话，还还持久一点，炒完就要吃了，所以说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你需要的时候，当场混一下，混一下就让他带回去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个本来那个痛的地方呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"打成粉，敷上去就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那敷上去就个粉会掉下来啊，对不对？那你用什么东西敷上去？你可以用一些油类的东西，哦，油脂的麻油啊或者什么呀，敷在上面或者什么都可以，哦，那就可以治疗头痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155801-kjd51d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155801-kjd51d9","updated":"20240422155804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看看这个处方有没有道理，真的有道理，这个诸位一看就知道有没有效，你想想看啊，一个人头痛哦，如果我们以西医的理论来说，那血管太小了，血通不过去，对不对？就会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"产生压力嘛，产生头痛，炮附子是不是很热？一贴上去血管就打开了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，哦，这个很有道理的哦，你看大概就知道效果好不好。"}]}]}